(STATE AEROSPACE & DEFENSE CORPORATION \(HAL/SADC\)) '
(REQUEST FOR PROPOSAL \(RFP\)) '
(Tender Title: Aerospace Precision Digitalization & Advanced Manufacturing Execution System \(MES\)) '
(Reference Number: HAL/2026/AERO-MES-404) '
(Estimated Project Value: INR 12.00 Crore \(INR 120,000,000\)) '
(Bid Submission Deadline: 21 Days from Publication Date) '
(Project Location: Heavy Aerospace Assembly & Defense Hangar) '
() '
(SECTION 1: DEFENSE & AEROSPACE MANDATORY ELIGIBILITY) '
(1.1 Aerospace Operational History:) '
(The Bidder MUST have at least 10 continuous years of operational experience strictly in Aerospace Manufacturing, Avionics Line Automation, and Defense Electronics Supply.) '
(1.2 Specialized Defense Domain:) '
(General software vendors or commodity trading firms are strictly disqualified from bidding.) '
(1.3 Security Clearance:) '
(The Bidder must possess Secret-level facility security clearance issued by the Ministry of Defense.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
