stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 40 780 Td 14 TL
(SECTION 4: KEY AEROSPACE STAFFING, RAPID SCHEDULE & SEVERE PENALTIES) '
(4.1 Specialized Aerospace Avionics Bench:) '
(The Bidder must assign a full-time Lead Avionics System Engineer possessing a Master degree in Aeronautical Engineering and 15+ years of aircraft assembly line automation experience.) '
(4.2 Rapid Prototype Schedule:) '
(An operational on-premise hardware prototype interfacing with physical CNC machine cells must be fully commissioned within 60 Days.) '
(4.3 Severe Liquidated Damages:) '
(Milestone delays will attract liquidated damages of 2% per week of delay up to a maximum cap of 20% of total contract value.) '
(4.4 High Value EMD Commitment:) '
(Mandatory EMD deposit of INR 2,400,000 via irrevocable Bank Guarantee.) '
ET
endstream
